>> title: Studio Chilli
>> course: dinner
>> servings: 6
>> source: Studio Cooking wiki

Brown @beef mince{500%g} in a #dutch oven{} and set it aside.

Soften @onion{2}, @peppers{2} and @garlic{3%cloves}, then add @chilli powder{2%tsp}, @cumin{2%tsp} and @tomato puree{2%tbsp}.

Return the mince with @kidney beans{400%g}, @chopped tomatoes{800%g} and @stock{300%ml}; simmer for ~{1%hour}.

Better the next day — make it on a Sunday for the week's late sessions.
